  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Womens Every Day Hoodie is the last sweatshirt you&rsquo;ll ever need or want! Crafted from a cozy cotton / polyester fabric blend that is breathable and soft to the touch, the essential hoodie features a fleece liner that provides all-day comfort and warmth, especially in the spring, fall, and winter seasons. The comfy fleece hoodie features a large double-layer string hood. Without a doubt, the Every Day Hoodie will become part of your go-to wardrobe!</p>",
