  "description": "<p>Our Womens Every Day Hoodie is the last sweatshirt you&rsquo;ll ever need or want! Crafted from a cozy cotton / polyester fabric blend that is breathable and soft to the touch, the essential hoodie features a fleece liner that provides all-day comfort and warmth, especially in the spring, fall, and winter seasons. The comfy fleece hoodie features a large double-layer string hood. Without a doubt, the Every Day Hoodie will become part of your go-to wardrobe! Perfect Fit: These comfortable hoodies are crafted with a tapered waist for the perfect all day fit. Whether you are traveling, working out, or lounging around, these hooded sweatshirts fit great, each and every time. Hidden Phone Pocket: The roomy front kangaroo pocket provides additional space for everyday essentials and features a hidden phone pocket for quick and easy storage. Who needs a bag when the Every Day Hoodie has you covered? Adventure Ready: These soft pullover hoodies feature active stretch side panels that enhance your mobility. The elastic ribbed knit cuffs and waist conform to your body without restricting your movement. In addition, the thumbholes preserve heat, maintain range of motion, and prevent sleeve ride-up while running. Complete the Look: Stay in fashion by pairing up your fleece hoodie with our Womens Vintage Paratrooper Fatigue Pants or Womens Leggings. Don&rsquo;t Leave Home Without It: The cozy hoodie is great for camping, hiking, jogging, traveling, sports, gym, everyday wear, and more. This is the one hooded sweatshirt you&rsquo;ll want to keep nearby!</p>",
